{"id":"n-20261020-o2r0wh","category":"business","display_title":"Global Markets Waver Amid Tech Volatility","display_title_he":"השווקים הגלובליים מתנדנדים בצל התנודתיות בסקטור הטכנולוגיה","short_summary":"Global stock markets experienced mixed performance as technology shares attempted to rebound from a steep slump, while weakening US housing data and upcoming earnings reports kept investors cautious.","english_level":"C1","words":481,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/1940_Census_Enumeration_District_Descriptions_-_Missouri_-_Platte_County_-_ED_83-9%2C_ED_83-10%2C_ED_83-11%2C_ED_83-12%2C_ED_83-13%2C_ED_83-14%2C_ED_83-15_-_NARA_-_5871173.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"Unknown author Unknown author or not provided · Public domain","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1940_Census_Enumeration_District_Descriptions_-_Missouri_-_Platte_County_-_ED_83-9,_ED_83-10,_ED_83-11,_ED_83-12,_ED_83-13,_ED_83-14,_ED_83-15_-_NARA_-_5871173.jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"Globes","domain":"globes.co.il","url":"https://www.globes.co.il/news/article.aspx?did=1001560060","title":"חמישה דברים שכדאי לדעת לקראת פתיחת המסחר בבורסה","published_at":"2026-10-20T05:15:00.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:15:00.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-20T06:17:50.289Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Global financial markets navigated a labyrinth of divergent signals on Tuesday, as renewed pressures across Asian trading floors contrasted with tentative stabilization in technology equities and ongoing anxiety over broader economic indicators. Equity markets across Asia retreated sharply, weighed down primarily by heavy sell-offs in major semiconductor manufacturers. South Korean chipmakers Samsung and SK Hynix posted substantial losses, dragging the local benchmark down by approximately four percent, while equity indexes in Tokyo and Hong Kong experienced synchronized declines of roughly one percent.","This Asian downturn mirrored persistent sector-specific volatility, even as Wall Street recorded a modest reprieve during its previous trading session. The SOXX semiconductor ETF snapped an unprecedented nine-day losing streak—its longest protracted slide since 2006—rising over two percent. The rebound was spearheaded by technology giants including Nvidia and AMD, offering temporary relief to an industry rattled by mounting concerns over massive debt burdens accumulated to fund artificial intelligence infrastructure. However, lingering skepticism was evident in cloud computing provider CoreWeave, which dipped slightly despite receiving a buy recommendation from Goldman Sachs following a dramatic weekly plunge that pushed its 2031 bond yields to an exorbitant fifteen percent.","Meanwhile, underlying macroeconomic indicators present a complex backdrop for global central banks. In the United States, homebuilder sentiment fell in October to its lowest level since June 2012, registering a reading of 29 on the National Association of Home Builders index. NAHB chief economist Robert Dietz highlighted that elevated mortgage rates, rising raw material costs, and severe labor constraints continue to depress prospective buyer traffic. Despite this real estate contraction, financial analysts remain divided on monetary policy trajectories. While market pricing reflects only a twenty percent probability of an immediate rate hike by the Federal Reserve, Bank of America forecasters contend that persistent inflation pressures could compel policymakers to raise interest rates, citing projections that core PCE inflation may reach 3.4 percent by the end of 2026.","In Europe, major exchanges in Frankfurt, London, and Paris all closed more than one percent lower against a backdrop of civil unrest in France and Italy. Fixed-income markets also experienced fluctuations, with the US ten-year Treasury yield rebounding to 5.14 percent following a brief flight to safety late last week.","Domestically, the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange closed lower overall, though defense and energy sectors displayed resilience. Defense contractor Elbit Systems advanced after securing a $235 million strategic agreement to supply PULS rocket artillery systems to Azerbaijan over three years. Looking ahead, market participants anticipate the Bank of Israel’s upcoming interest rate decision, where benchmark rates are widely expected to remain unchanged at 3.25 percent. According to analysts at Psagot Investment House, domestic monetary policy will likely remain cautious until post-election political conditions and long-term defense spending commitments become clearer, making prospective rate reductions improbable before early 2027.","Investors now pivot toward crucial corporate earnings releases, with streaming leader Netflix set to report quarterly results alongside highly anticipated announcements from tech titans Meta and Tesla."],"facts":[{"fact":"Asian stock markets fell sharply, with South Korea down about 4% driven by Samsung (-3%) and SK Hynix (-4.5%), while Tokyo and Hong Kong lost around 1%.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The SOXX semiconductor ETF rose over 2%, snapping a nine-day losing streak (the longest since 2006) led by gains in Nvidia and AMD, though CoreWeave dropped 0.4% despite a Goldman Sachs buy upgrade.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"US homebuilder confidence fell in October to 29, the lowest level since June 2012, due to high mortgage rates, raw material costs, and labor constraints.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Bank of America expects the Federal Reserve to raise interest rates in October due to inflation risks, predicting core PCE inflation could reach 3.4% by late 2026.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"European markets closed over 1% lower due to unrest in France and Italy.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Elbit Systems signed a $235 million contract to supply PULS rocket artillery systems and medium-range rockets to Azerbaijan over three years.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The Bank of Israel is expected to keep its benchmark interest rate unchanged at 3.25%, with Psagot estimating rate cuts may only occur in early 2027.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Netflix is set to report earnings today after market close, while Meta and Tesla report tomorrow.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Global","lemma":"global","pos":"adjective","he":"גלובלי, עולמי","name":false},{"text":"financial markets","lemma":"financial market","pos":"compound","he":"שווקים פיננסיים","name":false},{"text":"navigated","lemma":"navigate","pos":"verb","he":"ניווטו, התמודדו עם","name":false},{"text":"labyrinth","lemma":"labyrinth","pos":"noun","he":"מבוך","name":false},{"text":"divergent","lemma":"divergent","pos":"adjective","he":"מנוגדים, מסתעפים","name":false},{"text":"signals","lemma":"signal","pos":"noun","he":"אותות, אינדיקציות","name":false},{"text":"Tuesday","lemma":"Tuesday","pos":"name","he":"יום שלישי","name":true},{"text":"renewed","lemma":"renewed","pos":"adjective","he":"מחודשים","name":false},{"text":"pressures","lemma":"pressure","pos":"noun","he":"לחצים","name":false},{"text":"Asian","lemma":"Asian","pos":"adjective","he":"אסייתי","name":false},{"text":"trading floors","lemma":"trading floor","pos":"compound","he":"זירות מסחר","name":false},{"text":"contrasted","lemma":"contrast","pos":"verb","he":"עמדו בניגוד","name":false},{"text":"tentative","lemma":"tentative","pos":"adjective","he":"מהססת, זמנית","name":false},{"text":"stabilization","lemma":"stabilization","pos":"noun","he":"התייצבות","name":false},{"text":"technology","lemma":"technology","pos":"noun","he":"טכנולוגיה","name":false},{"text":"equities","lemma":"equity","pos":"noun","he":"מניות","name":false},{"text":"ongoing","lemma":"ongoing","pos":"adjective","he":"מתמשך","name":false},{"text":"anxiety","lemma":"anxiety","pos":"noun","he":"חשש, חרדה","name":false},{"text":"broader","